### Ohne Login -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/students
Accept: application/json

### Als User (susi) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/students
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic susi passme

### Als User (susi) anlegen -> 403
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic susi passme

{ "userid": "it1000", "firstname": "Gerald", "lastname": "Aistleitner" }

### Als Admin (max) anlegen -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic max passme

{ "userid": "it1000", "firstname": "Gerald", "lastname": "Aistleitner" }

### bcrypt-Hash + Salt für ein Passwort erzeugen (nur zum Üben!)
GET http://localhost:8080/passwords/passme
